### Initialize MCP session
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": "2025-03-26", "capabilities": {}, "clientInfo": {"name": "http-client", "version": "1.0"}}, "id": 0}

> {%
    client.global.set("mcpSessionId", response.headers.valueOf("Mcp-Session-Id"));
%}

### Send initialized notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{mcpSessionId}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "notifications/initialized"}

### List tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{mcpSessionId}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "tools/list", "id": 1}

### Call greet tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{mcpSessionId}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "greet", "arguments": {"name": "World"}}, "id": 2}
